// Witness traces for nft (4 interactive rounds)
// Round 1: owner must be able to mint a token
constructor
mint 1 42 | 0 0
---
// Round 2: token owner must be able to transfer their token
constructor
mint 1 42 | 0 0
transfer 1 2 42 | 1 0
---
// Round 3: approved spender must be able to call transferFrom
constructor
mint 1 42 | 0 0
approve 1 3 42 | 1 0
transferFrom 1 2 42 | 3 0
---
// Round 4: token owner must be able to burn their token
constructor
mint 1 42 | 0 0
burn 42 | 1 0
